  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <div class="what-we-do-grid">
    <div>
      <Icon name="scale" />
      <h3>Litigation</h3>
      <p>Organising and fighting legal challenges to state and national bans on safer nicotine products.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <Icon name="megaphone" />
      <h3>Public correction</h3>
      <p>Correcting misinformation in media coverage of vaping and tobacco harm reduction.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <Icon name="document" />
      <h3>Evidence library</h3>
      <p>Building an accessible record of research for policymakers, journalists and the public.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p>See our <a href="/litigation">litigation</a> and <a href="/press">press coverage</a> for the record of this work.</p>

  <h2>How AVI is funded and governed</h2>
  <p>
    AVI itself is not a registered legal entity. Domestic contributions in
    support of AVI's advocacy work are received and accounted for through
    <strong>Harm Reduction Policy &amp; Research Pvt. Ltd. (HRPR)</strong>,
    a private limited company registered with the Ministry of Corporate
    Affairs. This arrangement keeps contributions on the books of an
    audited, taxed entity rather than a personal account. AVI's founding
    director, Samrat Chowdhery, also directs HRPR.
  </p>

  <p>
    HRPR's CIN is <strong>U74999MH2020PTC336631</strong>. Contributions are
    recorded as company income, audited annually, and taxed accordingly —
    see <a href="/contribute">Contribute</a> for the full funding mechanism
    and disclosures.
  </p>
  <p>
    AVI does not accept funding from tobacco or nicotine product
    manufacturers. Overseas support for specific research or policy
    work is considered only as contracted, invoiced project work — see
    <a href="/contribute">Contribute</a> for what this means in practice.
  </p>

  <style>
    .stat-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin: 2rem 0;
      padding: 1.5rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .stat-row > div { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; }
    .stat-row :global(svg) { width: 1.5rem; height: 1.5rem; color: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; }
    .stat-row strong { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--ink); }
    .stat-row span { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); }

    .what-we-do-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }
    .what-we-do-grid :global(svg) { width: 1.75rem; height: 1.75rem; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .what-we-do-grid h3 { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .what-we-do-grid p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .what-we-do-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
